                                        Nepali women living in Germany: students, professionals, entrepreneurs, mothers, and women from all walks of life, who are looking to connect, share experiences, and grow together in a supportive community.
                                        <br><br>
                                        ​Join us, and be part of a community that inspires, uplifts, and connects Nepali women.
                                        <br><br>
                                        ​Registration is required to help us plan effectively.
                                        <br><br>
                                      <b>  ​About Women of Nepali Roots (WoNR):</b> <br>

                                        ​Women of Nepali Roots (WoNR) is a community initiative by Nepali Roots e.V., Germany, dedicated to connecting, empowering, and supporting Nepali women living in Germany. WoNR creates platforms for networking, mentorship, skill development, and shared learning, bringing together women from diverse backgrounds or professionals, students, entrepreneurs, and mothers to celebrate achievements, exchange experiences, and build a strong, supportive diaspora community.

                                        <br><br>

                                       <b> ​Note: Please note that this is a paid event with a fee of 15 EUR, intended solely to cover the cost of food.
                                        For payment details, please check your email.
                                       </b>
                                        <br><br>
                                        <b>Supported By: MORGEN e.V., Netzwerk Münchner, Migrantenorganisationen</b>
